WEBVTT

00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:32.446
because I like practicing on both sides.

00:07:32.446 --> 00:07:36.167
But I'd like to leave you with just that question:

00:07:36.167 --> 00:07:39.150
If you began to think of all the information that you consume

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.733
the way you think of food,

00:07:40.733 --> 00:07:42.507
what would you do differently?

00:07:42.507 --> 00:07:44.708
Thank you very much for your time.

00:07:44.708 --> 00:07:46.598
(Applause)